sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Tab A
  participant API as Backend API
  participant W as Report Worker
  participant DB as Database
  participant S as Socket.IO
  participant B as Tab B
  participant Cache as RTK Query Cache

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    A->>API: POST /reports/resend/:reportId
    API->>DB: update report status SENT
    DB-->>API: success
    API->>S: emit report:list-updated source=api reason=resent
    API-->>A: 200 success
    S-->>B: report:list-updated
    B->>Cache: invalidate report tag
    Cache->>API: refetch GET /reports
    API-->>Cache: latest reports
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    W->>DB: create report history and update setting in transaction
    DB-->>W: committed
    W->>S: emit report:list-updated source=worker reason=generated
    S-->>B: report:list-updated
    B->>Cache: invalidate report tag
    Cache->>API: refetch GET /reports
    API-->>Cache: latest reports
  end

